<Step ID="8" Task="Synthesizing the analysis results for all four stars (from Steps 4, 5, 6, and 7), which star best fits the condition of 'appearing redder than if it were located next to the Sun'? Justify your final conclusion." Difficulty="6" Rely="4,5,6,7"/>
